<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">1MAKOLINTE - Kapasa Kachinda</book>
  <para style="h">MAKOLINTE</para>
  <para style="toc1">IN’OLO LYE TANZI LYA PAULUSI KU MAKOLINTE</para>
  <para style="toc2">1Makolinte</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Makoli</para>
  <para style="mt2">IN’OLO LYE TANZI LYA PAULUSI KU</para>
  <para style="mt1">MAKOLINTE</para>
  <para style="imt">INZIBAAZO</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 1:1" />Paulusi uju naga kugigwa ukuba mutumigwa gwa Kilesite Jesu ko mugajalo gwa Nyambe, na musele gwetu Sositene.<verse eid="1CO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 1:2" />Ku nkeleke ja Nyambe ja mwa Kolinte, aba naba cenisigwa ka Kilesite Jesu no ku kugigwa abantu bakwe bacenite, na babo bonse aba naba kugigwa mwi zina lyo Mfumwetu Jesu Kilesite, Umfumwabo no Mfumwetu.<verse eid="1CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 1:3" />Mi inkumbu no nkozo jizwa kwa Nyambe Tata gwetu na Mfumu Jesu Kilesite jibe nenwe.<verse eid="1CO 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Imfwijaguzi mwa Kilesite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 1:4" />Mi inako jonse nasawa amalumbo kwa Nyambe kebaka lyenu, ke nkumbu jakwe iji naga wegwa ka Kilesite Jesu. <verse eid="1CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 1:5" />Ukuti namwa wegwa ulubono mutuito tonse, mu mufuta go mugambilo gonse no munzunu jonse,<verse eid="1CO 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 1:6" />Ukuti ubumpaki bwetu bwa Kilesite nabwa zuminizwa mukati kenu. <verse eid="1CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 1:7" />Mi cwale takuli iciwegwa co Moya ici mubulite namulindile ukubikulula ukunene kwa Mfumwetu Jesu Kilesite.<verse eid="1CO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 1:8" />Neje na mi gongoze kutwala ku mamaninino, buti na mu bule ici ci nyansgwe mwi juba lyo Mfumwetu Jesu Kilesite. <verse eid="1CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 1:9" />Nyambe ala sepaala, uju naga mi kuga mu kugwanana na Mwane Jesu Kilesite Mfumwetu.<verse eid="1CO 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Inkokani mu nkeleke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 1:10" />Bakwangu nasa mikumbila mwi zina lyo Mfumwetu Jesu Kilesite, buti mwense namu zuminane kwebi mugamba mi na kuleke kuba ne nkokani mukati kenu, kono namu kwatisane mu magano no mu migajalo. <verse eid="1CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 1:11" />Cwale bakwangu, abantu bamwinya bo luasi lwa Kiloe, naba ni gambaguza buti ko jili inkokani mukati kenu. <verse eid="1CO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 1:12" />Mi ici nigamba ciceci, jumwinya buti atyo, “Ime nili gwa Paulusi,” “neme nili gwa Apolosi,” “ime nili gwa Kefasi,” “neme nili gwa Kilesite.” <verse eid="1CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 1:13" />Buti Kilesite aliandene? Buti Paulusi kenu naga kankaminwa? Kampa mwi zina lya Paulusi namwa kolobezigwa?<verse eid="1CO 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 1:14" />Nasa litumela kwa Nyambe buti taa nana kolobeza umuntu kwenu, bwita Kilisipasi na Gayusi. <verse eid="1CO 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 1:15" />Cwale takuli uju agola uku gamba buti mwi zina lyangu naga kolobezigwa. <verse eid="1CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 1:16" />Ee kame nana kolobeza bo luasi lwa Sitefanasi, kuzwa kwababo tani buluki buti nana kolobeza umuntu jumwinya. <verse eid="1CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 1:17" />Ukuti Kilesite taa naga ni tuma uku kolobeza, kono ku tandaza ijwi isini ko inzunu jo Majwi Amalotu, buti icifapaano ca Kilesite cileke ukubula inguzu.<verse eid="1CO 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kilesite ni nguzu no nzunu ja Nyambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 1:18" />Ukuti ijwi lya cifapaano bugelo kwa babo bajunda, kono kwetu tu jojesigwa ni nguzu ja Nyambe. <verse eid="1CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 1:19" />Ukuti ku lin’oletwe buti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 1:19">“Kuti nani mane inzunu jaba bakwesi inzunu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 1:19">Mi no kutula kumbali byo kushugwisisa ko zigo.<verse eid="1CO 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 1:20" />Kwibo ali uju akwesi inzunu? Kampa kwibo ali umuzigi go mulao? Kampa kwibo ali uju azekelele bye longa? Buti Nyambe naga zola inzibo ja lelino ilonga kuji zola ubugelo?<verse eid="1CO 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 1:21" />Cwale Nyambe ke nzunu jakwe, asi kangwisa abantu uku muzekelela kwe nzunu jabo. Kono nangaceciba, asi gajite uku jojesa aba bazumina ku kutandaza ko bugelo uku ku zigigwa. <verse eid="1CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 1:22" />Amajuda basazunda ubumpaki ko mamakazo, kono Amageliki abo ni nzunu bashaka. <verse eid="1CO 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 1:23" />Kono iswe twasa tandaza bya Kilesite naga kankaminwa aci fapaano, inzigo iji ji cinga Amajuda, mi ku bantu basa ji bona bugelo. <verse eid="1CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 1:24" />Kono aba naba kugigwa kwa Nyambe, Amajuda no Mageliki, Kilesite ni nguzu ja Nyambe no nzunu ja Nyambe. <verse eid="1CO 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 1:25" />Ukuti ici ci bonaala sinagwe bugelo bwa Nyambe cili kwesi inzunu kuita inzunu jo buntu, mi ubukata bwa Nyambe buli kwesi inguzu kuita bo buntu.<verse eid="1CO 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 1:26" />Cwale bakwangu, mugaje ubu kamukalile aa namwa kugigwa. Kabali bace kwenu aba kaba kwesi inzunu jo mukalilo go buntu, bace aba kaba kwesi inguzu, mi bo luasi lo bumfumu kabali bace. <verse eid="1CO 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 1:27" />Kono Nyambe naga shala ibintu bye longa ibi bikwesi ubugelo, buti agenese ibi bikwesi inzunu, mi Nyambe naga shala ibi tabi gongwele bye longa buti agenese ibi bikwesi inguzu. <verse eid="1CO 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 1:28" />Nyambe gasa shala ibintu mwi longa ibi binyengwisa nebi tabi shakigwa, mane nebi tabi gwanaali, buti ibi bigwanaala abitende ibi tabigwanaali, <verse eid="1CO 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 1:29" />buti nakubule umuntu uju nalitunte kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="1CO 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 1:30" />Mi kakwe aa mukele kwa Kilesite Jesu uju naga tendigwa kwa Nyambe ko nzunu jetu, ne ko bugomba bwetu, nako kucenisigwa kwetu, neku liululwa kwetu. <verse eid="1CO 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 1:31" />Sinagwe ubu kun’olelwe buti, “Muleke uju alitunta, alitunte ko Mfumu.”<verse eid="1CO 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CO 2" />
  <para style="s1">Amajwi ga gamba bya Kilesite naga kankaminwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 2:1" />Bakwangu, Ime aa nana keza kwenu, keza kumiziga ubuzinda bo cote bwa Nyambe, taa nana litusisa icigambo ici kababu ne migajalo minene. <verse eid="1CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 2:2" />Ukuti kaguli mugajalo gwangu gu gongwele buti nani leke uku zekelela cimwinya kwenu, bwita Jesu Kilesite uju naga kankaminwa. <verse eid="1CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 2:3" />Cwale nana keza kwenu mu bujoge bunene no kututuma. <verse eid="1CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 2:4" />Mi amajwi gangu no kutandaza kwangu taa kajili jo ku mizuminiza ko majwi ge nzunu, kono kakuli ku bonisigwa inguzu jo Moya, <verse eid="1CO 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 2:5" />buti ukuzumina kwenu kuleke kulizinga a nzunu jo bantu, kono kulizinge anguzu ja Nyambe.<verse eid="1CO 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Inzunu ja Nyambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 2:6" />Nangaceciba, twasa gambe amajwi ge nzunu ku bantu ba kulite munzunu, kono isini inzunu ja jejino inako, kampa jo bujendesi bwa jejino inako, aba bugola uku joneka. <verse eid="1CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 2:7" />Kono twasa gambe inzunu ja Nyambe jo buzinda, ubu kabuzinditwe ku bantu, ubu nabwa shalilwa ituba lyetu ilonga nalisini uku bumbigwa. <verse eid="1CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 2:8" />Ku bajendesi bajejino inako, takuli nanga genke uju naga ji zekelela, mi ati naba ji zekelela, taa naba la kankamini Umfumu go kukebela. <verse eid="1CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 2:9" />Kono sinagwe ubu kun’olelwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:9">“Ici taa naca bonigwa kampa ku shugwigwa ku muntu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:9">Neci taa naca bumbigwa ko nzunu jo muntu buti kuti naci tendaale,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:9">Cecintu naga lukisa Nyambe kwa babo bamu shaka.”<verse eid="1CO 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 2:10" />Kono Nyambe naga bikulula ubuzinda bwakwe kwetu ko Moya gwakwe. Umoya gwasa shakisisa ibintu byonse, mane nebi bilibikite bya Nyambe. <verse eid="1CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 2:11" />Ukuti uju a zekelele imigajalo jo muntu bwita umoya bulyo gu kele kwakwe. Mi mu kutenda bobo, takuli uju a zekelele amagano ga Nyambe, bwita Umoya gwa Nyambe. <verse eid="1CO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 2:12" />Ici natwa tambula tali moya gwa lelino ilonga, kono Moya gu zwa kwa Nyambe, buti tulijelele ukushugwisisa ici naga tuwa bulyo Nyambe.<verse eid="1CO 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 2:13" />Cwale tatu gambi amajwi natwa zigigwa ko nzunu jo muntu, kono ko majwi natwa zigigwa ko moya, sinagwe aa tu tansulula icote jo moya kwa babo bakwesi Umoya. <verse eid="1CO 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 2:14" />Umuntu uju takwesi umoya tagoli kuzumina ibintu bizwa ku Moya gwa Nyambe, kono gasa biinda buti bya bugelo, mi tagoli uku bishugwisisa ukuti byasa zibigwa bulyo ko Moya. <verse eid="1CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 2:15" />Umuntu akwesi Umoya, ala gola ukuatula ibintu byonse, kono umuntu go kukala bobo tagoli uku atuligwa ku muntu. <verse eid="1CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 2:16" />Sinagwe ubu ku n’olelwe buti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:16">“Nini uju a zekelele umugajalo go Mfumu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:16">Uju agola uku mueleza?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 2:16">Kono iswe tulikwesi magano ga Kilesite.<verse eid="1CO 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CO 3" />
  <para style="s1">Abaika ba Nyambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 3:1" />Bakwangu, taa kani gola ukugamba kwenu sinagwe bantu bajoja ko Moya kono nasa gamba kwenu sinagwe bantu basijoja mwi longa, abanukegana bulyo kwa Kilesite. <verse eid="1CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 3:2" />Nana milela ko mabisi, isini ko bilyo bigongwele, ukuti taa kamu bigola. Mi neshunwano ta mubigoli, <verse eid="1CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 3:3" />ukuti musikele mwi longa. Ukuti musikwesi umuna ne nkokani mukati kenu. Cwale tamutendi sinagwe bantu ba mwi longa ubu batendele? <verse eid="1CO 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 3:4" />Umuntu jumwinya aa gamba buti, “Nili gwa Paulusi,” “jumwinya nasa nili gwa Apolosi,” buti tali muli bantu bulyo? <verse eid="1CO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 3:5" />Cwale Apolosi nini? Mi Paulusi nini? Baika ba Nyambe bulyo aba namwa zumina kwabo, umuntu gense ubu naga muwela Umfumu. <verse eid="1CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 3:6" />Nana byala imbuto, Apolosi naga ji sintagila, kono Nyambe naga leta buti ji kule. <verse eid="1CO 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 3:7" />Nangaceciba, gense uju abyala kampa uju a sintagila tabilaezi, kono ni Nyambe bulyo uju akulisa ibintu. <verse eid="1CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 3:8" />Gense uju abyala noju asintagila bonse musebezi gonke batenda, mi kuti naba gwane icitagilo kuja ko musebezi gwabo. <verse eid="1CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 3:9" />Mi iswe tuli babeleki ba Nyambe antuonke, muli begwa lya Nyambe, mi muli mijako ja Nyambe.<verse eid="1CO 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 3:10" />Ke nkumbu ja Nyambe, nana wegwa ukusumpa nenja sinagwe mujaki azekelele, mi jumwinya mpaa ajaka. Kono umuntu no muntu azekelele ubu ajakila. <verse eid="1CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 3:11" />Ukuti takuli uju agola uku sumpila kungi, bwita aa nana sumpila akale, uju ali Jesu Kilesite. <verse eid="1CO 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 3:12" />Ati umuntu gense nasumpa muku litusisa igauda, silibela, amabwe ga tula lwini, bishamu, bianda kampa katondo, <verse eid="1CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 3:13" />umusebezi go muntu no muntu kuti nagu bikululwe, ukuti ijuba lileza aa nagu bonaale akancenenene. Kuti nagu bonaale no mulilo, mi mulilo kuti nagu jakile ubunene bo musebezi go muntu no muntu. <verse eid="1CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 3:14" />Ati ici naca jakigwa na cisigale buzimene, umujaki kuti na tambule icitagilo. <verse eid="1CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 3:15" />Ati umusebezi nagu tentigwa, umujaki kuti na jonaukilwe, kono naje kuti na jojesigwe, sinagwe muntu naga anda kwi leba lyo mulilo.<verse eid="1CO 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 3:16" />Inwe tamu zekelele buti muli tempele ja Nyambe, no kutyo buti Umoya gwa Nyambe kwenu gu joja? <verse eid="1CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 3:17" />Ati umuntu gense na jona itempele ja Nyambe, Nyambe kuti na jone jojo umuntu, ukuti tempele ja Nyambe jili cenete, mi nenwe mwense muli jejo itempele.<verse eid="1CO 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 3:18" />Muleke uku lioma mwebeni. Ati jumwinya mukati kenu na gaja buti alikwesi inzunu ja jejino inako, inwe muli jelele ukuba ibigelo, buti na mube bo nzunu. <verse eid="1CO 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 3:19" />Ukuti ubutali bwa lelino ilonga kuba bugelo mu mensho ga Nyambe. Mi sinagwe ubu ku n’olelwe buti, “Gasa shumina uju akwesi inzunu mu butali bwakwe,” <verse eid="1CO 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 3:20" />mi kame buti kun’olelwe, “Umfumu ali zekelele buti imigajalo jaba bakwesi inzunu taji kwesi intuso.” <verse eid="1CO 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 3:21" />Nangaceciba, umuntu aleke uku litunta ko bajendesi mu umpilila, ukuti ibintu byonse byenu, <verse eid="1CO 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 3:22" />Paulusi na Apolosi kampa Kefasi, kampa ilonga kampa ubumi no lufwu, shunu ne jona, byonse byenu, <verse eid="1CO 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 3:23" />mi muli ba Kilesite, mi Kilesite gwa Nyambe.<verse eid="1CO 3:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CO 4" />
  <para style="s1">Abatumigwa ba Kilesite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 4:1" />Nangaceciba, mulijelele ukugaja buti tuli baika ba Kilesite, aba nabawegwa ukujendesa amagano ga zinditwe ga cote ga Nyambe. <verse eid="1CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 4:2" />Mi cwale ici ci shakaala ku baika aba naba gwana ubuntuawa balijelele ukuba ne ntumelo. <verse eid="1CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 4:3" />Cwale ime tani bilaeli aa ni atuligwa kwenu kampa ku nkuta jibo kampa jibo jo buntu, kampa mane tani goli ukuliatula nemwini. <verse eid="1CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 4:4" />Tani liwene umulandu, kono tani gambi buti tani kwesi umulandu. Nu Mfumu uju agola uku ni atula. <verse eid="1CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 4:5" />Cwale muleke uku atula icintu cimwinya inako najisini ukusika, mulindile Umfumu aa nakeze. Nije nalete mwi tuba ibi bilibikite mwififi, mi na bikulule imigajalo jili mu myojo jo bantu. Mwa jejo inako umuntu gense kuti na tambule amalumbo gazwa kwa Nyambe.<verse eid="1CO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 4:6" />Cwale bakwangu, nana gamba bobo ko manguli kuja kangu ne Apolosi buti mugwane cimwinya, buti mane muli zige kwetu ici gutalusa gogu mugambagwilo gutyo buti, “Muleke ukutanta ubu kun’olelwe.” Umuntu aleke ukulitunta ko muntu jumwinya no kunyungulula jumwinya. <verse eid="1CO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 4:7" />Cwale nini naga kutenda buti uleke ukulikoza ne bamwinya? Cinzi ici ukwesi ici taa nagwa wegwa? Mi ati nagwa citambula, cinzi aa ulitunta sinagwe taa nagwa wegwa?<verse eid="1CO 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 4:8" />Se muli kwesi ibintu byonse mushaka! Muli kwesi ulubono! Namwa tatika ukuba abamfumu mi iswe natusini, ni wawa kani jangala aa na mube bamfumu buti neswe natube abamfumu antuonke nenwe. <verse eid="1CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 4:9" />Ukuti kula bonaala buti, Nyambe naga tu tula abatumigwa akancenene, kuba mwishule lyo mamaninino, sinagwe bantu naba atulwilwa ukuyagigwa ankanza. Natwa tendigwa ukulolelwa kwi longa lyonse lyo mangiloi no bantu. <verse eid="1CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 4:10" />Kebaka lya Kilesite natwa zoka abagelo, kono inwe mulikwesi inzunu ka Kilesite. Tuli bauba, kono inwe muli bagongo. Mula kutikigwa, iswe tatu kutikigwa. <verse eid="1CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 4:11" />Kusika mwi nako jejino tu fwanga injala ne nyotwa, mu bizwato byo kucancauka tuzwesi, twasa tendigwa bubi, tatukwesi ukutukala nenja. <verse eid="1CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 4:12" />Twasa beleka lwini ko maganja getu. Aa tu mfwijigwa, twasa mfwijagulwa, aa tu pengisigwa, twasa gongozigwa, <verse eid="1CO 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 4:13" />aa tu lwisigwa, twasa taba nenja. Natwa tendigwa amasati ge longa, ifulo lyo bantu bonse kusika jejino inako.<verse eid="1CO 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 4:14" />Aa ni n’ola bobo tali kuta buti kame ni migenisa, kono kame ni shaka kumi nanguza mwe banangu bashakigwa. <verse eid="1CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 4:15" />Nanga na mukwesi abazigi ba 10,000 ka Kilesite, ta mukwesi ubungi bo besenu, ukuti nime nana mizala ka Jesu Kilesite ko majwi. <verse eid="1CO 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 4:16" />Cwale nasa miindikiza buti muni jelekeze. <verse eid="1CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 4:17" />Mi cwale nana tuma Timoteya mwanangu uju ni shaka, uju asepaala ku Mfumu. Kuti nami bulukise imikalilo jo bumi bwangu kwa Kilesite Jesu, ubu buzuminana nebi ni ziga mu mankeleke gonse.<verse eid="1CO 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 4:18" />Bamwinya basa litunta sinagwe taa nana keza kwenu. <verse eid="1CO 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 4:19" />Kono wangu-wangu kuti nani keze kwenu, ati Umfumu na shaka, mi ao kuti nani gwane isini amajwi bagamba abantu balitunta, kono inguzu jabo iji bakwesi. <verse eid="1CO 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 4:20" />Ukuti Umubuso gwa Nyambe tali gwa kugamba bulyo mu majwi kono mwi nguzu. <verse eid="1CO 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 4:21" />Cinzi mushaka? Ni keze kwenu ne kacwepu, kampa ke cisemo na ko moya umulotu?<verse eid="1CO 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CO 5" />
  <para style="s1">Icise mu Nkeleke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 5:1" />Ni ntaba ji gambigwa buti kocili cise mukati kenu, mi cise co kukala buti ici taci gwanaali ku bantu bo cibi ici cityo, jumwinya umuntu alale ne mukazi gwesi. <verse eid="1CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 5:2" />Mi mwasa litunta! Mi tamu jelele ukufwa inse kwa jojo uju naga tenda bobo buti azwisigwe mukati kenu? <verse eid="1CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 5:3" />Cwale ime, nanga tamu niwene mutumbi, nili kele nenwe mu moya, sinagwe uju akele nenwe. Mi mwi zina lyo Mfumu Jesu nana atula jojo muntu uju naga tenda bobo, nani sikele nenwe koko, kale nanawa umulandu jojo umuntu naga tenda bobo mwi zina lya Mfumwetu Jesu. <verse eid="1CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 5:4" />Mi aa se mula gwanani antuonke, cwale ime, mukati kenu ni kele ko moya, ko nguzu ja Mfumwetu Jesu uju akele neswe, <verse eid="1CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 5:5" />kuli kele nenja buti jojo muntu awegwe mu maganja ga Satani buti umubili gwakwe gu joneke, mi umoya gwakwe nagu gole ka jojesigwa mwi juba lyo Mfumu.<verse eid="1CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 5:6" />Ukulitunta kwenu takukele nenja. Tamu zekelele buti umumela umuce gula gola uku tundulukisa ubusu bonse. <verse eid="1CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 5:7" />Mucenese umumela umukulukulu, buti mube umukamu umuya, mi mubule umumela. Ukuti Kilesite, Impaseka jetu, naga tendigwa icitagilo. <verse eid="1CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 5:8" />Cwale tubotele umukiti gwetu gwe Mpaseka, isini ko nsima je kwesi umumela umukulukulu, umumela go cibi ne cise, kono cinkwa ici tacikwesi umumela, ceci icinkwa ca kucena ne cote.<verse eid="1CO 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 5:9" />Mwi n’olo ili nana min’olela, nana mi gambaguza buti muleke uku gwanana no bantu bo cise. <verse eid="1CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 5:10" />Mi taa kani talusa buti abantu bonse ba lelino ilonga mba cise, kampa ba nkole no muna, kampa aba ba cencelela abazimu. Muku tenda bobo muli jelele ukusiga lelino ilonga <verse eid="1CO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 5:11" />Kono nasa mi n’olela buti tamu jelele ukugwanana no muntu uju aliwete ukuba bakwakwe, kono nali go cise ne nkole, uju cencelela bazimu, kampa go manya, kampa icidakwa, kampa umusa. Muleke uku jeleka ukulya no muntu go kukala bobo.<verse eid="1CO 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 5:12" />Ukuti ni nguzunzi ni kwesi jo kuatula aba bakele anze jo nkeleke? Tamu jelele uku atula aba bakele mu nkeleke? <verse eid="1CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 5:13" />Nyambe kuti na atule aba bakele kunze. Mutande umntu mubi mukati kenu.<verse eid="1CO 5:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CO 6" />
  <para style="s1">Abazumini taba jelele ukulizekisa mwacabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 6:1" />Ati jumwinya gwa kwenu nakwesi inkonkani ne mugenze, cwale mulijelele ukutwala intaba ku bantu taba zekelele Nyambe? Muli jelele ukutwala ku bantu bazekelele Nyambe. <verse eid="1CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 6:2" />Kampa tamu zekelele buti abantu bo Mfumu kuti naba atule ilonga? Mi ati namu atula ilonga, cwale tamu jelele ukuatula imizeko iminunu? <verse eid="1CO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 6:3" />Tamu zekelele buti kuti natu atule amangiloi? Aa tugola bobo, buti natu kangwile ukuatula ibintu bya bobuno ubumi? <verse eid="1CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 6:4" />Cwale ati muli kwesi inkonkani jo kukala bobo, cinzi mubi twalila ku bantu taba zekelele byo nkeleke? <verse eid="1CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 6:5" />Nasa gamba bobo buti mugene. Ukuti mukati kenu, takuli uju akwesi lwini inzunu uju agola ukuatula inkonkani jili mukati ko bazumini? <verse eid="1CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 6:6" />Kono jumwinya gasa twala mugenze ku nkuta, ubuso bo bantu tabazumini.<verse eid="1CO 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 6:7" />Mwasa kaja ku makuta aa mukwesi inkonkani mukati kenu, ceci cintu cibonisa buti namwa likangwa wawa. Cinzi aa tamu zumini ukufosekezwa? Cinzi aa tamuzumini ukuomigwa? <verse eid="1CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 6:8" />Kono inwe mwasa oma no kujona, mi aba mutenda bobo bazumini bagenzenu. <verse eid="1CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 6:9" />Tamu zekelele nenja buti abantu babi taa naba jobole Umubuso gwa Nyambe? Muleke ukulioma, bo bitendantu bibi, aba bacencelela bazimu, bo cise, no bakwame aba bali sesa mwacabo, <verse eid="1CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 6:10" />abasa, bo nkole, ibidakwa, bomanya, bijoni taa naba jobole Umubuso gwa nyambe. <verse eid="1CO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 6:11" />Mi bamwinya bobo kaba kalile. Kono namwa sanzigwa, mi namwa cenesigwa, mi namwa tendigwa bagomba mwi zina lyo Mfumu Jesu Kilesite ne ko Moya gwa Nyambe gwetu.<verse eid="1CO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mubonaaze ituba lyo Mfumu ko mibili jenu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 6:12" />Bamwinya basa tyo, “Nili jelele ukutenda ibintu byonse, kono ibintu byonse tali bilotu. Ee nili jelele ukutenda ibintu byonse, kono taa nani zumine ukujendesigwa kwa bimwinya. <verse eid="1CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 6:13" />Mwasa tyo buti, “Ibilyo bya mwivumo, mi ivumo lya bilyo, mi Nyambe kuti nabi jone byonse. Cwale umubili tali gwa cise, kono ngwa Nyambe, mi Umfumu ne mwini mubili. <verse eid="1CO 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 6:14" />Mi Nyambe naga busa Umfumu kuzwa ku bafwu, mi neswe kuti natu buswe ke nguzu jakwe.<verse eid="1CO 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 6:15" />Tamu zekelele buti imibili jenu nja lubazu lwa Kilesite? Ukuti ni inde ulubazu lwa Kilesite kubitenda ibilama byo muntu go cise? Taji golaali! <verse eid="1CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 6:16" />Tamuzekelele buti uju agwanana no muntu go cise gasa zoka umubili gonke neje? Ukuti buti kutyo, “Bobile kuti nababe bo mubili gonke.” <verse eid="1CO 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 6:17" />Kono gense uju agwanana no Mfumu neje akele naje mu moya.<verse eid="1CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 6:18" />Mujoge icise. Icibi conse ici atenda umuntu, kunze jo mubili gwakwe cikele, kono gense uju atenda icibi co cise, mi gasa fosekeza umubili gwakwe. <verse eid="1CO 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 6:19" />Tamu zekelele buti imibili jenu ni tempele jo Moya go Kucena, ugu gu kele kwenu, ugu namwa tambula kuzwa kwa Nyambe? Tamu goli uku lijendesa, Nyambe neje ami jendesa. <verse eid="1CO 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 6:20" />Naga migula ko mugulo umunene. Mi cwale mu lumbe Nyambe ko mibili jenu.<verse eid="1CO 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CO 7" />
  <para style="s1">Impuzo ka byo maseswa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 7:1" />Cwale kuja ko mantaba aga namwa ni n’olela, buti nityo, “Kuli kele nenja buti umukwame aleke ukusesa. <verse eid="1CO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 7:2" />Kono mu kujoga icise, umukwame gense alisese no mukazi, mi umukazi alisese no mukwame. <verse eid="1CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 7:3" />Umukwame atendele umukazi gwakwe ici ci shakaala mu maseswa, mi no mwanakazi atende bobo ku mukwame gwakwe. <verse eid="1CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 7:4" />Umukazi takwesi inguzu egulu lyo mubili gwakwe, kono munguzu jo mukwame gu kele. Mu kutenda bobo, umukwame takwesi inguzu egulu jo mubili gwakwe, kono munguzu jo mukazi gwakwe gu kele. <verse eid="1CO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 7:5" />Muleke ukunyimana kono bwita aa muzuminana mwi nako jimwinya, muli tule ku kulapela. Kono byebyo aa se bilamani, muli bogoze, buti Satani aleke uku mi jeleka mu kubula u kuligunga kwenu.<verse eid="1CO 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 7:6" />Kono aa ni gamba bobo, kumi toleisiza, tali kumiwa umulao. <verse eid="1CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 7:7" />Ka ni shaka buti abantu bonse bakoze sinagwe nime, kono muntu no muntu kocili ici naga muwa Nyambe, joju naga muwa ceci, jumwinya cecilya.<verse eid="1CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 7:8" />Cwale kwa babo taba sesite, ne banakazi bo bamfwilwa buti nityo, ubulotu mukale mu bu namukuka sinagwe nime. <verse eid="1CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 7:9" />Kono aba bakangwa ukuligunga basese kampa ukusesigwa, ukuti ubulotu kusese kuita uku liyaza inshandi.<verse eid="1CO 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 7:10" />Ku bantu basesete no kusesigwa, iji ne ndagano ni bawa isini ime kono ku Mfumu jizwa, umwanakazi ta jelele uku likana no mukwame gwakwe. <verse eid="1CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 7:11" />Kono ati natenda bobo, ali jelele ukukala ubu namukuka kampa uku libogoza no mukwame gwakwe. Mi no mukwame ta jelele uku lukulula umukazi gwakwe.<verse eid="1CO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 7:12" />Cwale kwa bamwinya buti nityo, ime wawa isini Umfumu, ati umukwame uju a zuminite alikwesi umwanakazi uju ta zuminite, mi ala shaka ukujoja no mukwame gwakwe, ta jelele uku lukulula umwanakazi. <verse eid="1CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 7:13" />Mi ati mwanakazi alikwesi umukwame uju ta zuminite, mi ala shaka ukujoja no mwanakazi gwakwe, ta jelele uku lukulula umukwame. <verse eid="1CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 7:14" />Ukuti umukwame uju ta zuminite gasa cenisigwa kebaka lyo mwanakazi gwakwe, mi ne mwanakazi uju tazuminite gasa cenisigwa kebaka lyo mukwame gwakwe uju zuminite. Ati tali bobo abanenu taba cenete, kono abo naba cenite. <verse eid="1CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 7:15" />Kono ati uju ta zuminite aa shaka uku liambusa, mu muleke atende bobo. Umuzumini go mukwame kampa go mwanakazi ta shuminitwe mwi ntaba jo kukala bobo, Nyambe naga mikugila ukujoja mu nkozo. <verse eid="1CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 7:16" />Mwanakazi buti ugajila, bunga kuti no jojese mukwame gwako? Kampa buti ugajila, bunga kuti no jojese mukazi gwako?<verse eid="1CO 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mujoje sinagwe ubu ashakila Nyambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 7:17" />Umuntu no muntu ali jelele ukujoja kuja ubu naga muwela Umfumu, sinagwe ubu ka kalile aa naga kungigwa kwa Nyambe. Gogu go mulao ni ziga mu mankeleke gonse. <verse eid="1CO 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 7:18" />Umukwame naga kugigwa nala gegelezwi ku mukanda? Aleke ukutenda sinagwe taa naga gegelezwa ku mukanda. Mi ati umukwame uju taa naga kaja kuku gegelezwa ku mukanda aa tambula uku kugigwa kwa Nyambe, aleke kaja kuku gegelezwa ku mukanda. <verse eid="1CO 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 7:19" />Ukuti ukuja kampa ku saja kuku gegelezwa ku mukanda, taku talusi cimwinya. Mi icilotu bulyo kuzumina imilao ja Nyambe. <verse eid="1CO 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 7:20" />Muntu gense ajoje ubumi ubu kajoja mwi nako naga kugigwa kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="1CO 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 7:21" />Ati koli muika aa nagwa kugigwa, uleke uku bilaela. Kono aa ugwana akaito ko ntukuluo, utende bobo. <verse eid="1CO 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 7:22" />Ukuti umuntu gense uju kali muika aa naga kugigwa mu ntumelo ku Mfumu, naga lukululwa ku Mfumu. Mi cwale gense uju naga lukululwa aa naga kugigwa se muika gwa Kilesite. <verse eid="1CO 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 7:23" />Namwa guligwa mugulo umunene, muleke uku zoka abaika bo bantu. <verse eid="1CO 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 7:24" />Bakwangu, umuntu gense akale abuso bwa Nyambe ubu ka kalile mwi nako iji naga kugigwa.<verse eid="1CO 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Impuzo jo kusasesigwa no bamfwilwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 7:25" />Cwale kuja ko bantu aba taba sesitwe no kusesa, tali ni ndangano jizwa ku Mfumu, kono mugajalo gwangu niwa ko muntuawa ko cisemo co Mfumu.<verse eid="1CO 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 7:26" />Mi kebaka lyo makababu ga jejino inako, nasa gaja buti kuli kele nenja umukwame ku kala ubu akalile. <verse eid="1CO 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 7:27" />Kwali umwanakazi nagwa gungilikiza? Ulijelele ukali shumununa. Tokwesi umukazi? Toshaki ukusesa? <verse eid="1CO 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 7:28" />Kono ati nosesa, tola tendi icibi, mi umwalyansho aa sesigwa, tala tendi icibi. Kono babo aba basesa kuti naba gwane amakababu mwa bobuno bumi, ime tani shaki ukumikanisa kukala bobo.<verse eid="1CO 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 7:29" />Bakwangu, ici ni gamba ci ceci, inako seni mfuwi, kuzwa aano babo aba bakwesi abanakazi, balijelele ukujoja sinagwe taba sesite, <verse eid="1CO 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 7:30" />aba balila, batende sinagwe taba lili, aba bajangele, batende sinagwe taba jangele, aba bagula, batende sinagwe tali byabo nababika, <verse eid="1CO 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 7:31" />aba bali tusisa ibintu bye longa, bakale sinagwe aba taba pateisigwe kwa byebyo. Ukuti lelino ilonga, sinagwe ubu likalile jejino inako, mi umukalilo gwa lelino ilonga kuti nagumane. <verse eid="1CO 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 7:32" />Ici ni shaka ca kuti muleke kukala no mapilaelo. Umukwame uju tasesite atokomele byo Mfumu, ubu a jelele uku jangalikiza Umfumu. <verse eid="1CO 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 7:33" />Kono umukwame uju asesite gasa zundamina ibintu bya lelino ilonga, ubu ajelele uku jangalikiza umukazi gwakwe, <verse eid="1CO 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 7:34" />mi ukulumbila kwakwe kuliandene. Umwanakazi uju tasesitwe kampa umwalyansho uju tasesitwe ba zundamine umusebezi go Mfumu, umugajalo gwakwe ngwa ku zundamena ku Mfumu mu mubili ne mu moya. Kono umwanakazi uju asesitwe gasa zundamena mu bintu bya lelino ilonga, ubu jelele uku jangalikiza umukwame gwakwe.<verse eid="1CO 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 7:35" />Nasa gamba bobo ukuti nila shaka uku tusa. Tali kame ni shaka ukumibinda, kono buti mujoje mu nzila ji botete namu zundamine ku Mfumu.<verse eid="1CO 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 7:36" />Ati umuntu nagaja buti cintu ci fwisa inshoni mwane go mukazana aa kula kuba umwalyansho ta sesigwa, ao atende ubu ashakila, mi ati migajalo jakwe minene, mi ali lishugwile buti ali jelele ukusesa, atende bobo ubu ashakila. Ta tendi icibi. Bali jelele uku lisesa. <verse eid="1CO 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 7:37" />Kono ati takuli ici ci indikiza umukwame ukutenda bobo, mi gasa lishugwa wawa buti ta jelele ukusesa, mi ati muntu uju aligungite, uju a gajite ukusasesa, kuli kele nenja ukuzwa ku mugajalo go kusasesa. <verse eid="1CO 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 7:38" />Cwale uju asesa umwalyansho gasa tenda nenja, kono umukwame uju tamusesi gasa tenda nenja.<verse eid="1CO 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 7:39" />Umwanakazi azundamine ku mukwame gwakwe nasi joja. Kono umukwame gwakwe aa fwa, ali jelele uku sesigwa ku mukwame uju ashaka gense, mi ali jelele kuba ku Mfumu. <verse eid="1CO 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 7:40" />Kono mugambagwilo gwangu gu gogu, aa nakale bobo, kuti na nyanguluke wawa, mi neme nasa gaja buti neme nili kwesi Umoya gwa Nyambe.<verse eid="1CO 7:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CO 8" />
  <para style="s1">Impuzo ka byo bilyo bitagilwa abazimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 8:1" />Cwale kuja ko bitagilo bitendelwa bazimu, tuli zekelele buti, “Twense tuli kwesi inzunu.” Kono inzunu jasa leta uku litunta, kono icisemo casa jakisa. <verse eid="1CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 8:2" />Mi abantu aba bagaja buti bali zekelele cimwinya, basini ukuzekelele ubu bajelele ukuzekelela. <verse eid="1CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 8:3" />Kono gense uju ashaka Nyambe, ali zekelelwe kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="1CO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 8:4" />Mi cwale ko bilyo bi tagilwa abazimu, tulizekelele buti, abazimu taba kwesi cimwinya momuno mwi longa, takuli Nyambe jumwinya kono neje genke bulyo. <verse eid="1CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 8:5" />Kono nanga na kukele aba bakugigwa bazimu kwigulu na ansi (bobo ku kalile ko bali “bazimu” no “tumfumwana” tungi, <verse eid="1CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 8:6" />kono kwetu, Nyambe genke bulyo Tata, uju naga bumba ibintu byonse, mi twasa joja kakwe, takuli jumwinya kono Umfumu Jesu Kilesite, a na kwazwa ibintu byonse, mi kakwe tujoja.<verse eid="1CO 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 8:7" />Kono tali bantu bonse bakwesi jeji inzunu. Abantu bamwinya bali sholele abazimu bo maswaniso, mane aa balya ibilyo byo bitagilo basa gaja sinagwe ku bazimu bala bitagili, balikwesi izwalo ili lifokola, mi basa lishugwa sinagwe byebyo bilyo byasa ba sitagalisa. <verse eid="1CO 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 8:8" />Kono ibilyo tabi goli uku tu senekeza afuwi na Nyambe, nanga tatubili, tatu goli ku jonekelwa cimwinya. Mi takuli ici natu gwane nanga na tu bilya.<verse eid="1CO 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 8:9" />Kono munangule buti intukuluo jenu jileke ukuba iji naji gwise aba bafokola. <verse eid="1CO 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 8:10" />Mi ati jumwinya aa bona, umukwame gwe nzunu nalya mu tempele jo maswaniso, tagole ukuindikizwa ukulya ibilyo nabya tendelwa amaswaniso? <verse eid="1CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 8:11" />Mi cwale umuntu uju afokola kuti nafwe kebaka lyo nzunu jakwe, uju ali mukwako uju naga fwilwa kwa Kilesite. <verse eid="1CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 8:12" />Aa mu fosekeza bakwenu nenwe bobo, mi mwasa kubaza amazwalo gabo, go kufosekeza Kilesite. <verse eid="1CO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 8:13" />Cwale ati icilyo naci nginika mugenzangu mu cibi, ime tani silyi kame inyama, buti nani leke uku sitagalisa abakwangu.<verse eid="1CO 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CO 9" />
  <para style="s1">Inguzu no misebezi jo Mutumigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 9:1" />Ime tani lukuluwite? Ime tali nili mutumigwa? Taa nana bona Jesu Mfumwetu? Tali ninwe bo mubonaalilo go musebezi gwangu mu Mfumu? <verse eid="1CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 9:2" />Ku bamwinya nanga tani kele mutumigwa, kwenu nili mutumigwa gwenu. Ukuti inwe, ninwe ulukanko lo butumigwa bwangu mu Mfumu.<verse eid="1CO 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 9:3" />Mi bobo nili gambilila a niwegwa umulandu ku bantu. <verse eid="1CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 9:4" />Cwale tatu kwesi inguzu jo kulya no kunwa? <verse eid="1CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 9:5" />Mi tatu kwasi inguzu ukuinda umukazi asesitwe uju azuminite ukujenda neswe, sinagwe batumigwa bamwinya ne bancegwe bo Mfumu no Kefasi? <verse eid="1CO 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 9:6" />Kampa nime bulyo no Bbanabbasi tatu kwesi inguzu ukubeleka aa tuli jojesesa? <verse eid="1CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 9:7" />Nini umusole uju agola ku lilifa? Nini uju abyala igwa lya veine mi talyi ibiyango byalyo? Nini alisa umugono talyi amabisi gajo? <verse eid="1CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 9:8" />Buti nasa gamba bobo ko nguzu jo buntu? Umulao nago tali bobo gu tyo? <verse eid="1CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 9:9" />Sinangwe ubu ku n’olelwe mu mulao gwa Mushe buti, “Uleke ukufuka akanwa ke pulu aa lisetula maila. Nyambe ukuti ta babaleli amapulu? <verse eid="1CO 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 9:10" />Kampa Nyambe gasa gamba bobo kebaka lyetu? Ee, byebi niswe nabya ng’olelwa, buti uju alima alijelele ukulima ko nsepo, mi uju adunkula amaila, adunkule ko nsepo naga wegweko. <verse eid="1CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 9:11" />Ati natwamwaga imbuto jo moya mukati kenu, cwale tatu jelele uku tambula ibilyo no binywantu kwenu? <verse eid="1CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 9:12" />Ati bamwinya naba tagila gogu mugajalo mulotu kwenu, tatu jelele ukuba nago mubungi? Kono taa na twa litusisa nenja jeji inguzu, buti tuleke uku zindilwa amajwi malotu ga Kilesite. <verse eid="1CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 9:13" />Cwale tamu zekelele buti aba ba beleka mu Tempele basa gwana ibilyo byabo mu Tempele, mi aba ba beleka ku citagilo basa litagila ici bawa ku citagilo. <verse eid="1CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 9:14" />Mu mukwa go kulikoza, Umfumu naga tu laga buti aba batandaza amajwi malotu bajelele ukutambula ibi bagwana mu majwi malotu.<verse eid="1CO 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 9:15" />Kono tani la litusisi jimwinya jo inguzu. Mi tani n’oli byebi muku sepa buti namu tende ibintu byo ku kala bobo kwangu, kono ime icilotu kufwa, isini umuntu ani bulise akaito kweci ni litunta kaco. <verse eid="1CO 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 9:16" />Cwale aa ni tandaza amajwi malotu, tani goli uku litunta, ukuti nili jelele ukutandaza. Ubumpai bwangu ati tani tandazi amajwi malotu! <verse eid="1CO 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 9:17" />Ati nani tandaza muku litombola, nili kwesi umupuzo, kono ani tenda uku tanishaki, ao kame ni tenda bulyo umusebezi nanawegwa. <verse eid="1CO 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 9:18" />Cwale gwibo umupuzo gwangu? Ngwa kuti aa ni tandaza amajwi malotu, ni tandaze amajwi malotu lya Kilesite uku tani gwanimo cimwinya, ni leke ukulitusisa inguzu jangu jo kuba umutandazi jo majwi malotu.<verse eid="1CO 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 9:19" />Nanga nani lukuluwite ku bantu bonse, nana litenda umuika go bantu bonse buti ni mune ubungi bo bantu. <verse eid="1CO 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 9:20" />Ku Majuda nana zoka sinagwe Majuda mu kumuna amajuda. Kwa babo bakele mwisiko lyo mulao nanaba sinagwe uju akele mwisiko lyo mulao (kono ime tani kele mwisiko lyo mulao), kono muku shaka kumuna bulyo aba bakele mwisiko lyo mulao. <verse eid="1CO 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 9:21" />Kwa babo aba taba kwesi umulao, nasa tenda sinagwe uju takwesi umulao, (kono tani lukuluwite ku mulao gwa Nyambe kono mwisiko lyo mulao gwa Kilesite ni kele, buti nimune aba taba kwesi umulao. <verse eid="1CO 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 9:22" />Ku bauba nasaba umuuba, buti nimune abauba. Ku bantu bonse nana litenda ibintu bonse buti ni lagola ukujojesa bamwinya.<verse eid="1CO 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 9:23" />Nasa tenda ibintu byonse kebaka lyo majwi malotu, buti ni gwanemo imfwijaguzi jajo. <verse eid="1CO 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 9:24" />Tamu zekelele buti mu kutiga, abatigi bonse batiga, kono genke bulyo agwana umupuzo. Mutige lwini buti nenwe namu gwane umupuzo. <verse eid="1CO 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 9:25" />Umuntu gense uju akangaana mu bizano ali jelele ukutokomela ibi naga zigigwa. Basa tenda bobo buti bagwane iciusi ici taa naci kalilile, kono twasa tenda bobo buti natu gwane iciusi ici naci kalilile. <verse eid="1CO 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 9:26" />Cwale tani tigi sinagwe muntu uju ali tigila bulyo, kame tanilwi sinagwe mulwi ashonja mafaindi mu moya. <verse eid="1CO 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 9:27" />Nasa golomeza umubili gwangu ku mafaindi, buti aa seni latandazi ku bamwinya, buti nani leke ukugwanigwa nisigala mubizano.<verse eid="1CO 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CO 10" />
  <para style="s1">Uku nanguzwa ko maswaniso go bazimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 10:1" />Bakwangu, kame ni shaka buti muzekelele ibi nabya tendaala ku basukuzetu bonse aa kabali mwisiko lye joba, mi bonse kale baitile mwiwate. <verse eid="1CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 10:2" />Bonse naba kolobezigwa mwi joba na muziba mu kugwanana atonke na Mushe. <verse eid="1CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 10:3" />Bonse na balya ibilyo byo moya byo kulikoza, <verse eid="1CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 10:4" />mi nabanywa icinwantu co moya go kulikoza, ukuti nabanywa kwibwe lyo moya ili kali bajendisa, mi lelyo ibwe kali Kilesite. <verse eid="1CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 10:5" />Nangaceciba, Nyambe ta naga nyanguluka kwabo byonse, imibili jabo naja mwagala mu mangusu.<verse eid="1CO 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 10:6" />Cwale byebi ibintu nabya tendaala ko myanza, kutu nanguza buti imyojo jetu jileke ukulumbila ibintu ibimangoju sinagwe ubu naja tendela. <verse eid="1CO 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 10:7" />Kame muleke ukukumbila ku bazimu sinagwe ubu naba tendela bamwinya. Sinagwe ubu kun’olelwe buti, “Abantu nabakala ansi kulya no kunwa, mi kale bazimana no kulingininga mu kunenga. <verse eid="1CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 10:8" />Kame tuleke ukutenda icise, sinagwe bamwinya bakwabo ubu nabatendela, mi mwijuba lyonke abantu ba 23,000 nabafwa. <verse eid="1CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 10:9" />Tatu jelele ukujeleka Kilesite, sinagwe ubu naba tendela bamwinya, mi naba yagigwa ku majoka. <verse eid="1CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 10:10" />Muleke uku tongauka, sinagwe ubu naba tongaukila bamwinya, mi naba yagigwa ku ngiloi lyo lufwu.<verse eid="1CO 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 10:11" />Byebi ibintu nabya tendaala kwabo buti gube umwanza, mi nabya n’oligwa buti tunanguzwe, iswe natwa kezelwa kwi nako jo mamaninino. <verse eid="1CO 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 10:12" />Mi cwale, ati uju agaja buti alizimene bugongwele, mumamele buti namuleke ukugwa! <verse eid="1CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 10:13" />Taa namwa kezelwe ku mujeleko ugu tagoli umuntu. Mi Nyambe gwa cisemo, taa nakulekelele ujelekigwa kuitilila intikanyo. Kono aa ujelekigwa, kuti na kuwe kaito buti uli gongoze momo mujeleko.<verse eid="1CO 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 10:14" />Mi cwale bashakigwa basele bangu, musunduluke ku bazimu. <verse eid="1CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 10:15" />Nasa gamba ku bantu aba bashugwilisa, muli atule mwebeni kwebi nigamba. <verse eid="1CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 10:16" />Inkomosi jo mfwijaguzi iji tuli tumela kajo, mi tali kugwanana no malowa ga Kilesite? Insima iji tu komagula tali mubili gwa Kilesite? <verse eid="1CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 10:17" />Ukuti cinkwa conke, mi nanga na tuli bangi tuli ba mubili gonke, ukuti twense twasa litaila icinkwa conke. <verse eid="1CO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 10:18" />Mugaje abantu ba Isilaele, tali babo aba balya ibitagilo bililya alutala? <verse eid="1CO 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 10:19" />Cwale cinzi ni talusa? Ibilyo bitagilwa amaswaniso tali cintu, kampa iciswaniso cintu? <verse eid="1CO 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 10:20" />Tali bobo, kono ibitagilo byo maedeni byasa wegwa ku mayauma, isini kwa Nyambe. Mi tani shaki buti inwe mugwanane no mayauma. <verse eid="1CO 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 10:21" />Tamu goli ukunywina mu nkomosi jo Mfumu ne mu nkomosi jo mayauma, tamu goli ukulya kwebyo ntafule jo Mfumu, mi ne kwebyo ntafule jo mayauma. <verse eid="1CO 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 10:22" />Cwale buti nu Mfumu tu shomagiza buti atu fwile umuna? Tuli kwesi inguzu ku muita?<verse eid="1CO 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 10:23" />“Nili kwesi inguzu jo kutenda ibintu byonse,” mwasa tyo, kono ibintu byonse bya butokwa. “Nili kwesi inguzu jo kutenda ibintu byonse,” kono tali byonse bikwesi intuso. <verse eid="1CO 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 10:24" />Kuleke ku gwanaala umuntu uju atenda ici cimu jelele genke bulyo, kono ici ci jelele ne bamwinya.<verse eid="1CO 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 10:25" />Mulye conse ici gulisigwa ku mayagilo ge nyama, mi muleke ku buza kebaka lyo nkengejezi. <verse eid="1CO 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 10:26" />Ukuti ilonga lya Mfumu, mi nebi bilimo byonse.<verse eid="1CO 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 10:27" />Ati umuntu uju tazuminite naku kugila ku mulisuko mi ula shako ukaja, ulye byonse ibi biletigwa kwako, uleke uku buza cimwinya kebaka lyo nkengejezi. <verse eid="1CO 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 10:28" />Kono ati umuntu natyo kwako buti, “Byebi bitagilo byo bazimu, cwale uleke ukulya byebyo ibilyo, kebaka lya jojo ala kunanguzi na kebaka lyo nkengejezi.” <verse eid="1CO 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 10:29" />Nasa gamba ku nkengejezi jo muntu jumwinya, isini jako. Cwale cinzi intukuluo jangu aa ji atuligwa ku nkengejezi ja jumwinya umuntu? <verse eid="1CO 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 10:30" />Ati nani litumela kwa nyambe ko bilyo byangu, cinzi ni nyazigwa ko bilyo niwa ubu litumelo kwa Nyambe?<verse eid="1CO 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 10:31" />Cwale nanga na mulya kampa kunywa kampa conse ici utenda, uci tende conse muku lumbeka Nyambe. <verse eid="1CO 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 10:32" />Uleke uku letela umuntu jumwinya uku sitagala, nanga Mujuda, kampa Mugeliki kampa inkeleke ja Nyambe. <verse eid="1CO 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 10:33" />Sinagwe ime ubu ni tendela uku jangaza abantu bonse, tani tendi ibi bi jelele ime bulyo, kono nasa tenda ibi bijelele abantu bangi buti naba jojesigwe.<verse eid="1CO 10:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CO 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 11:1" />Muni jelekeze, sinagwe ime aa ni jelekeza Kilesite.<verse eid="1CO 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Co kuzwata ku mutwi aa mukumbila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 11:2" />Cwale nasa miwa malumbo ukuti mula ni gaja mu bintu byonse, mi mu zundamine ku cizo ubu nana ji mi zigila. <verse eid="1CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 11:3" />Kono nasa shaka buti muzekelele umutwi go mukwame gense ni Kilesite, mi umutwi go munakazi mukwame, cwale umutwi gwa Kilesite ni Nyambe. <verse eid="1CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 11:4" />Umukwame gense uju akumbila kwa kampa ukugamba amajwi ga Nyambe na jabele iciusi ku mutwi, gasa shwaula umutwi gwakwe. <verse eid="1CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 11:5" />Kono umwanakazi gense uju a kumbila kwa Nyambe kampa ukugamba amajwi ga Nyambe uku takuli ici ali shuminite ku mutwi, gasa shwaula umutwi gwakwe, kulili kozete no ku likulula umutwi gwakwe. <verse eid="1CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 11:6" />Mi ati umwanakazi uku takuli ici ali shumine ku mutwi gwakwe, ali jelele buti no nshuki jakwe ji kululigwe, kono ati ni nshoni umwanakazi uku likulula insuki kampa umutwi gwakwe, cwale ali jelele uku lishumina ku mutwi. <verse eid="1CO 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 11:7" />Mi umukwame ta jelele uku jabala iciusi ku mutwi gwakwe, ukuti ije ciswaniso ne kute lya Nyambe, kono umwanakazi ni kute lyo mukwame. <verse eid="1CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 11:8" />Ukuti umukwame taa naga zwa ku mwanakazi, kono umwanakazi ku mukwame azwa. <verse eid="1CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 11:9" />Kame umukwame taa naga bumbigwa kebaka lyo mwanakazi, kono umwanakazi ku mukwame naga bumbigwa. <verse eid="1CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 11:10" />Mukutenda bobo umwanakazi ali jelele ukuba ne cisupo ku mutwi co kuti ala jendesigwa, kebaka lyo mangiloi. <verse eid="1CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 11:11" />Nangaceciba, mu Mfumu umwanakazi ku mukwame alizingite, kame no mukwame ku mwanakazi alizingite. <verse eid="1CO 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 11:12" />Ukuti umwanakazi ku mukwame naga zwa, mi no mukwame naje mwanakazi naga muzala. Kono ibintu byonse kwa Nyambe bizwa.<verse eid="1CO 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 11:13" />Cwale muli atule mwebeni, kulikele nenja umwanakazi ku kumbila kwa Nyambe uku tali shuminite ku mutwi? <verse eid="1CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 11:14" />Ko mukalilo go bintu, tabi mizigi buti ati umukwame alikwesi inshuki inde, kashwau kwakwe, <verse eid="1CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 11:15" />kono ati umwanakazi ali kwesi inshuki inde, tali kujangala kwakwe? Ukuti naga wegwa inshuki inde iji ji muvwika ku mutwi. <verse eid="1CO 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 11:16" />Umuntu gense uju a shaka ukuleta inkokani, gogu umukalilo tagu kuli kwetu, tagu kuli ne ku mankeleke ga Nyambe.<verse eid="1CO 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umulalilo go Mfumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 11:17" />Cwale mundagano ji nungako tani goli ukumilumba, ukuti inkongani jenu jasa mikubaza lwini kuita ubulotu. <verse eid="1CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 11:18" />Intaba je tanzi ni jeji, nana shugwa buti aa mugwanana mu nkeleke, mo jili inkokani mukati kenu, mi bunga neme nasa zumina bobo. <verse eid="1CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 11:19" />Kuli jelele ukuba no nkokani mukati kenu, buti kuzibaale aba bakwesi icote mukati. <verse eid="1CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 11:20" />Mi cwale aa mu gwanana antounke, tali mulalilo go Mfumu mulya, <verse eid="1CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 11:21" />ukuti aa mulya, muntu no muntu gasa litangiza ukulya ibilyo byakwe kumbali. Mi jumwinya alifwite injala, mi jumwinya ali dakwite. <verse eid="1CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 11:22" />Tamu kwesi amajugo go kulila no kunwa? Kampa mwasa shwaula inkeleke ja Nyambe no kugenisa abantu taba kwesi cimwinya? Buti saka nityo? Ni milumbe? Kwa byebyo tani milumbi. <verse eid="1CO 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 11:23" />Ukuti ime, nana tambula ku Mfumu ici nana miwa, Umfumu Jesu, amasiku naga legezigwa, naga inda icinkwa, <verse eid="1CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 11:24" />mi aa sala litumeli, kale aji komagula no kutyo buti, “Gogu mubili gwangu, muinde mulye, mutende bobo namu nibuluka.” <verse eid="1CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 11:25" />Mu mukwa go kulikoza, aa sebala mani ukulalila kale ga inda inkomosi no kutyo buti, “Jeji inkomosi nja busele ubuya mu malowa gangu, mutende bobo, inako jonse aa munywinamo, muku nibuluka.”<verse eid="1CO 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 11:26" />Ukuti inako jonse aa mulya ceci icinkwa no kunywina momu mu nkomosi, kuti na mu lugule ulufwu lo Mfumu kusika ana kezele. <verse eid="1CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 11:27" />Mi cwale, umuntu gense uju alya icinkwa kampa ukunywina mu nkomosi jo Mfumu mu mukwa tagu jelele, kuti nabe no mulandu go mubili no malowa go Mfumu. <verse eid="1CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 11:28" />Umuntu gense ali jelele uku litatuba jemwini, nasini ukulya icinkwa no kunywa mu nkomosi. <verse eid="1CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 11:29" />Ukuti umuntu gense uju alya no kunywa ta nanguli umubili gwa Kilesite, gasa lya no kunywa inkatulo jakwe. <verse eid="1CO 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 11:30" />Mi mu kutenda bobo, ubungi mukati kenu mwasa fokola no kulwala, mi bamwinya nabafwa. <verse eid="1CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 11:31" />Kono ati natu litatuba twebeni, taa natu nangule. <verse eid="1CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 11:32" />Nangaceciba, aa mu atuligwa mu mukwa go kukala bobo ku Mfumu, twasa lagigwa buti ku mamaninino natu leke kanyansigwa ne longa.<verse eid="1CO 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 11:33" />Mi cwale bakwangu, aa mugwanana mu kulya umulalilo go Mfumu, muli jelele ukulya mwense. <verse eid="1CO 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 11:34" />Umuntu gense uju afwite injala ali jelele ukulya cimwinya ku njugo, buti ukugwanana kwenu na kuleke uku mi gwanisa umulandu. Mi ibintu bimwinya kuti nani bigunge aa nani keze.<verse eid="1CO 11:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CO 12" />
  <para style="s1">Ibiwegwa byo Moya go Kucena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 12:1" />Bakwangu, tani shaki buti mubule inzunu kuja ko Moya go Kucena. <verse eid="1CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 12:2" />Muli zekelele buti aa kamuli baedeni, kamu kokelwa ku bazimu aba tabagambi, ubu kamu jendekezwa. <verse eid="1CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 12:3" />Mi cwale nasa shaka mu zekelele buti, takuli umuntu uju agamba ko Moya go Kucena gwa Nyambe atyo buti, “Jesu akutigwe!” Mi takuli uju na gambe buti Jesu nu Mfumu, bwita na jendesigwa ko Moya go Kucena. <verse eid="1CO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 12:4" />Mi ibiwegwa byo Moya biliandene, kono Umoya gogo gutaangila. <verse eid="1CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 12:5" />Mi kuli andene mu misebezi, kono Umfumu gwa kulikoza abelekelwa. <verse eid="1CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 12:6" />Mi imisebezi jiliandene, kono Nyambe go kulikoza uju abeleka imisebezi jonse ku bantu bonse. <verse eid="1CO 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 12:7" />Mi uku libonaaza ko Moya, gulawegwe ku bulotu bonse. <verse eid="1CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 12:8" />Mi ko Moya jumwinya gasa wegwa amajwi go butali, jumwinya gasa wegwa amajwi go nzunu ka gogo Umoya go kulikoza. <verse eid="1CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 12:9" />Jumwinya gasa tambula intumelo ka gogu Umoya, jumwinya gasa tambula impo jo kuoza amalwele ka gogu Umoya. <verse eid="1CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 12:10" />Jumwinya gasa wegwa inguzu jo kutenda ibitendantu, jumwinya gasa wegwa ububoni, jumwinya kushalula imyoya, jumwinya kugamba mwindimi ji andene, mi jumwinya ku tansulula ibigambo. <verse eid="1CO 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 12:11" />Byebyo byonse byasa belekigwa ku Moya gonke, ugu gutagila umuntu ne muntu ubu gu shakila.<verse eid="1CO 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umubili gonke gwa bilama ibingi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 12:12" />Kilesite gwa kukoza sinagwe mubili go muntu, ugu gu kwesi ibilama ibingi, kono byonse byasa bumba umubili gonke, mi ne Kilesite bobo akalile. <verse eid="1CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 12:13" />Ukuti twense matwa kolobezigwa ko Moya gonke buti tubumbe umubili gonke, kube Majuda kampa Mageliki, nanga baika kampa aba naba lukuluwa, mi twense natwa nywisigwa ku Moya gonke.<verse eid="1CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 12:14" />Mi cwale umubili tali pa lubazu lonke nagwa bumbigwa kono abibazu ibingi. <verse eid="1CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 12:15" />Cwale ati itende nalityo, “Ukuti tali nili ganja, tani kuli ku mubili,” lelyo tali goli ukuba ibaka ili ligola uku likangwisa ukuba ulubazu lo mubili. <verse eid="1CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 12:16" />Mi ati ukutwi na kutyo buti, “Ukuti tali nili linsho, tani kuli ku mubili,” lelyo tali goli ukuba ibaka ili ligola uku kukangwisa ukuba ulubazu lo mubili. <verse eid="1CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 12:17" />Ati umubili gonse kaguli linsho, ukushugwa kwibo na kuzwila? Ati mubili gonse kaguli kutwi, ukuumbuza kwibo na kuzwila? <verse eid="1CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 12:18" />Kono Nyambe naga tula ibibazu mu mubili, ulubazu no lubazu ubu lujelele uku kalila. <verse eid="1CO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 12:19" />Ati byonse kabi kele icilama conke, umubili kwibo kagu kala? <verse eid="1CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 12:20" />Cwale ibilama bingi, kono mubili gonke.<verse eid="1CO 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 12:21" />Ilinsho tali goli uku tyo kwi ganja buti, “Tani kushaki!” Mi no mutwi tagu goli uku tyo ku matende buti, “Tani kushaki!” <verse eid="1CO 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 12:22" />Cwale ibilama byo mubili bi bonaala uku fokola, bebyo butokwa wawa. <verse eid="1CO 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 12:23" />Mi ibilama byo mubili ibi tugaja buti tabi kutikigwa, bebyo tukutika wawa no kuita. <verse eid="1CO 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 12:24" />Mi ibilama ibi tulolele tabi kwesi cimwinya. Kono Nyambe naga gwanika umubili antuonke, mi no kuwa ikute inene kwa bebyo ibilama bi jelele uku kutikigwa, <verse eid="1CO 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 12:25" />buti kuleke ukuba ne kulitaa ko mubili, kono ibilama byago bili babalele ne cimwinya. <verse eid="1CO 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 12:26" />Ati cilama cimwinya naci penga, ibilama byonse byasa penga, ati cilama conke naci kutikigwa, byonse bilama byasa jangala.<verse eid="1CO 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 12:27" />Cwale inwe muli mubili gwa Kilesite, mi mwense muli ba lubazu lyago. <verse eid="1CO 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 12:28" />Mi Nyambe naga tula tansila batumigwa mu nkeleke, babili baboni, batatu bazigi, ko kutula aba batenda ibitendantu, ibiwegwa byo kulwalukisa, byo kutusa, byo kubusa, ne byo ndimi ji andene. <verse eid="1CO 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 12:29" />Buti bonse batumigwa? Buti bonse baboni? Buti bonse basa tenda ibitendantu? <verse eid="1CO 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 12:30" />Buti bonse naba wegwa uku lwalukisa? Buti bonse bala gamba mu ndimi? Buti bonse bala tansulula? <verse eid="1CO 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 12:31" />Mi mu mulumbile ibiwegwa ibinene.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 12:31">Mi cwale kuti ni misunde inzila ilotu wawa.<verse eid="1CO 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CO 13" />
  <para style="s1">Icisemo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 13:1" />Ati nani gamba mu ndimi jo bantu kampa jo mangeloi, uku tani kwesi cisemoshaki, nili mulangu bulyo gu lila, kampa kakumbo kanene bulyo. <verse eid="1CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 13:2" />Ati nili kwesi ciwegwa co buboni, nili zekelele ibi bi bikitwe byonse nebyo nzunu byonse, mi ati nili kwesi intumelo ji jenda, iji jigola uku ningula amalundu, kono tani kwesi icisemo, nili cintu bulyo. <verse eid="1CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 13:3" />Mi nanga na niwa ulubono ulu nikwesi ku bampale, mi niwe umubili gwangu ku leligwa nenja buti ni litunte, kono ati tani kwesi icisemo, tanigwani cimwinya. <verse eid="1CO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 13:4" />Icisemo kulindila, icisemo bugomba, tali kuba no muna, tali kulitunta, tali kuliwa. <verse eid="1CO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 13:5" />Icisemo tali ku shwaula bamwinya, icisemo tali ku lishaka gwemwini, icisemo tali kunyegela wangu, icisemo tali kubikila ubumangoju. <verse eid="1CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 13:6" />Icisemo taci zumini ibi tabi kele nenja, kono casa jangala ne cote. <verse eid="1CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 13:7" />Icisemo inako jonse casa babalela, cili kwesi intumelo ku bintu byonse, cili kwesi insepo ku bintu byonse, cila gongoza mu bintu byonse.<verse eid="1CO 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 13:8" />Icisemo taci kangwi. Kono ububoni kuti na bumane, ne ndimi kuti naji lekwe ukugambwa, ne nzunu kuti naji buligwe. <verse eid="1CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 13:9" />Ukuti ukuzekelela kwetu kwa lubazu, mi no buboni bwetu bwa lubazu, <verse eid="1CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 13:10" />kono ibintu bi kondete inako nabi keze, bya kulubazu lumwinya kuti nabijunde.<verse eid="1CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 13:11" />Aa kanili mwanukegana, kanigambanga sinagwe mwanuke, kani shugwa sinagwe mwanuke, kani gaja sinagwe mwanuke, kani shugwisisa sinagwe mwanuke. Kono aa seni lakuli kuba umukwame, kale nana leka byo bwanuke. <verse eid="1CO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 13:12" />Ici tulolele jejino inako, ciswaniso cili mucimponi, kono kubuso kuti naci bonaale wawa. Cwale aano bya lubazu bulyo ni zekelele, kono kubuso kuti nani bizekelele wawa byonse sinagwe ubu ni zekelelelwe.<verse eid="1CO 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 13:13" />Mi cwale kobili ibintu byotatwe nabi sigale, ni ntumelo, ni nsepo no cisemo. Kono kwa byebyo byotatwe icinene lwini cisemo.<verse eid="1CO 13:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CO 14" />
  <para style="s1">Ibiwegwa bizwa ku Moya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 14:1" />Muzundamine mu cisemo mi mushake ibiwegwa byo Moya, byo kukoza byo buboni. <verse eid="1CO 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 14:2" />Ukuti gense uju agamba mu ndimi, ta gambaguli ku bantu kono kwa Nyambe. Mi takuli uju abi shugwisisa, byasa gamba ibi tabi zekelelwi ko Moya. <verse eid="1CO 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 14:3" />Kono umuboni gense gasa gamba amajwi ga Nyambe ku bantu mu ku bagongoza, kuba indikiza, no kuba sengasenga. <verse eid="1CO 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 14:4" />Umuntu gense uju agamba mwi ndimi gasa litusa ge mwini, kono umuganununi gense gasa tusa inkeleke jonse.<verse eid="1CO 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 14:5" />Mi nasashaka buti mwense mu gambe mu ndimi, kono cinene aa muba baboni. Gense uju abona munene kuita uju agamba mu ndimi, bunga nakuli uju tansulula, buti inkeleke najo jigwane intuso. <verse eid="1CO 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 14:6" />Cwale bakwangu, ati aa ni keza kwenu nasa gamba mu ndimi, bulotunzi ubu ni jelele kwenu? Bunga bwita aa ni gamba nenwe ko ntaba nana bikulwilwa jo magano kampa jo nzunu kampa jo buboni kampa ijwi lyo ndagano.<verse eid="1CO 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 14:7" />Bobo ku kalile ne ku bintu tabi joji, ibi bi kwesi umulumo sinagwe kasengo, kampa impindo, ati nabi sibigwa umulumo gonke, buti saka ku shugwaalile kasengo kala sibigwa kampa ni mpindo? <verse eid="1CO 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 14:8" />Kame ati intolombita taji shugwaali nenja umulumo aa ji lila, nini uju saka litukiseza inkondo? <verse eid="1CO 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 14:9" />Mu mukwa go kulikoza, nenwe aa ta muleti ko lulimi intaba iji ji shugwaala, buti naku zekelelwe ici cigambigwa? Kuti na bibe byo ku gamba munkuli. <verse eid="1CO 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 14:10" />Mwilonga mo jili imishobo imingi ji andene, kono takuli nanga gonke ugu tagu kwesi intalusa. <verse eid="1CO 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 14:11" />Kono ati tani zekelele umushobo ugu gu gambigwa kwa jumwinya, kuti nibe sinagwe nili muzwa malonga ku mugambi, mi no mugambi kuti abe muzwa malonga kwangu. <verse eid="1CO 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 14:12" />Cwale nenwe, aa mu zundamina mu kugwana byo biwegwa byo Moya, mujeleke uku shakisisa ibi biletela inkeleke ukuja abuso.<verse eid="1CO 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 14:13" />Ukuti umuntu gense uju agamba indimi taji zekelelwa, akumbile buti agole no ku tansulula ibi agamba. <verse eid="1CO 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 14:14" />Mi ati nani kumbila mu ndimi, umoya gwangu gwasa kumbila, kono inzunu jangu tagi kwesi ibiyango. <verse eid="1CO 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 14:15" />Cwale buti ni jelele uku tendela? Kuti ni kumbile no moya gwangu, kono kame kuti nani kumbile no kushugwisisa kwangu, kuti nani zimbe no moya gwangu, kono kame kuti nani zimbe no kushugwisisa kwangu. <verse eid="1CO 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 14:16" />Mi cwale aa muli tumela kwa Nyambe mu Moya bulyo, umuntu uju ategeleza mu nkeleke, buti na gongolekeze uku kumbila kwako koku litumela uku saka ugambe buti, “Ameni” uku tazekelele ibi agamba? Ta kwesi akaito kamwinya aka saka shugwe ibi ugamba. <verse eid="1CO 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 14:17" />Nanga nakuba buti intapelo jako jo ku litumela ni ndotu lwini, kono jumwinya umuntu tagwani intuso.<verse eid="1CO 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 14:18" />Nasa lumba Nyambe buti nasa gamba mwi ndimi ku miita mwense. <verse eid="1CO 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 14:19" />Kono mu nkeleke, ici ni shaka kugamba ko nzunu jo majwi ga tosanwe buti ni zige bamwinya, isini ukugamba mu mushobo tagu shugwaali majwi aga ga sika amyanda jo makumi go makumi.<verse eid="1CO 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 14:20" />Bakwangu, muleke ukugaja sinagwe banuke. Mube abacece ku cibi, kono mu kugaja kwenu mube abakulu. <verse eid="1CO 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 14:21" />Ku lin’olitwe mu Mulao buti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">Umfumu buti atyo, “Ko ndimi jimwinya ne ko mushobo go mazwa malonga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 14:21">Kuti nani gambe bobo kwa baba abantu, nanga taa naba nitegeleze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">Kuti ni gambange mu mushobo tamu zekelele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 14:21">Kono nabo abantu taa naba ni tegeleze.”<verse eid="1CO 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 14:22" />Cwale indimi cisupo kwaba tabazumini, isini aba bazumina, kono ububoni cisupo kwaba bazuminite, isini kwaba tabazuminite, kono aba bazumina.<verse eid="1CO 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 14:23" />Mi ati inkeleke jonse naji gwanana antuonke mi abantu bonse naba gamba mwi ndimi, nanga saka ku ngine abantu taba kwesi inzunu, kampa aba taba zuminite, taba goli ukutyo buti kame mubulumuka? <verse eid="1CO 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 14:24" />Kono bonse aa babona, nanga na kungina uju tazumini, kampa uju ta zekelele ububoni, kuti azumine kwabo bonse, gasa atuligwa kwabo bonse. <verse eid="1CO 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 14:25" />Mi ibi bikitwe bya mu mojo gwako byasa bikululwa, mi cwale kuti nagwile ansi, no kutongamina Nyambe, mi agambe buti, “Ni cote Nyambe mwali mukati kenu!”<verse eid="1CO 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Inkozo mu Nkeleke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 14:26" />Bakwangu, cwale buti tu jelele ukugambila? Aa mugwanana antonke, umuntu no muntu ali kwesi ulwimbo, kampa ijwi lyo kuziga, kampa byo magano, kampa byo ndimi, kampa ku ntansulula bye ndimi. Ibintu byonse bili jelele uku tendigwa buti inkeleke jila gola ukukula. <verse eid="1CO 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 14:27" />Ati umuntu na gamba mwi ndimi, kugambe bobile, kampa botatwe, mu kuliwa inako, mi jumwinya na ntansulula. <verse eid="1CO 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 14:28" />Kono ati takuli uju antansulula, umugambi ali jelele ukuombelela mu nkeleke no kugamba genke ne kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="1CO 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 14:29" />Ababoni bobile kampa botatwe bali jelele ukugamba, mi bamwinya batatube nenja ici ci gambigwa. <verse eid="1CO 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 14:30" />Mi ati amagano nageza kwa jumwinya uju akele, umu gambi gwe tanzi a ombelele ukugamba. <verse eid="1CO 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 14:31" />Ukuti mula gola ukubona mwense mu kugwana icibaka buti abantu bonse bazigigwe, mi bonse bazundamine. <verse eid="1CO 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 14:32" />Imyoya jo baboni jasa jendisigwa ku baboni. <verse eid="1CO 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 14:33" />Ukuti Nyambe tali ni Nyambe go nkokani kono go nkozo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 14:33">Sinagwe ubu kukalile mu mankeleke gonse go bantu ba Nyambe. <verse eid="1CO 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 14:34" />Abanakazi bali jelele ukuombelela mu mankeleke. Taba zuminizwi ukugamba, kono bali tule kwinsi sinagwe ubu gutyo umulao. <verse eid="1CO 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 14:35" />Ati naba shaka uku zekelela ibintu, bali jelele uka buza abakwame babo ku njugo, ukuti kashwau umwanakazi uku gamba mu nkeleke.<verse eid="1CO 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 14:36" />Ukuti ijwi lya Nyambe kwani nalya tatikila ukeza? Kampa ninwe bulyo nalya kezela? <verse eid="1CO 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 14:37" />Ati jumwinya aa linangula buti muboni, kampa umuntu uju akwesi iciwegwa co moya, ashugwisise buti ibi nimi n’olela ni ndagano jo Mfumu. <verse eid="1CO 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 14:38" />Kono ati jumwinya tatwalikizi inzunu kwa ceci, naje taa natwalikizwe inzunu.<verse eid="1CO 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 14:39" />Cwale bakwangu, mutwale imyojo jenu ku buboni, mi muleke ukukanisa ukugamba mwi ndimi. <verse eid="1CO 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 14:40" />Kono ibintu byonse bitendigwe ubu kujelele, ne ko mulao.<verse eid="1CO 14:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CO 15" />
  <para style="s1">Ukubuka kwa Kilesite ku bafwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 15:1" />Bakwangu, cwale nasa shaka uku mi bulusa Amajwi Malotu aga nana tandaza kwenu, aga namwa tambula no bu mugongwela kwago. <verse eid="1CO 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 15:2" />Ka gago Majwi Malotu namwa jojisigwa, ati namu zundamina kwijwi nana tandaza kwenu, mi ukuzumina kwenu kwa mbwashula.<verse eid="1CO 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 15:3" />Ukuti nana mi tambika tanzi byo butokwa ibi nana tambula, buti Kilesite naga fwa kebaka lyo bibi byetu, sinagwe ubu ku n’olelwe mu man’olo, <verse eid="1CO 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 15:4" />buti naga zikigwa, mi kale abuka mwijuba lyatatu, ubu ku n’olelwe mu man’olo. <verse eid="1CO 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 15:5" />Mi kale gali bonaaza kwa Kefasi ne ku bekumi na bobile. <verse eid="1CO 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 15:6" />Mi kale galibonaaza kame ku bantu kaba itilila imyanda ja tosane (500) mwi nako jonke, ubungi bamwinya kwabo basi joja, mi bamwinya naba fwa. <verse eid="1CO 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 15:7" />Mi kale gali bonaaza kwa Jemusi, mi kame no ku batumigwa bonse.<verse eid="1CO 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 15:8" />Mi ku mamaninino ga babo bonse, kale ga libonaaza kame kwangu, ime nanili ciomo. <verse eid="1CO 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 15:9" />Ukuti ime tanili go butokwa ku batumigwa, mi tani jelele uku kugigwa umutumigwa, ukuti nana pengisa inkeleke ja Nyambe. <verse eid="1CO 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 15:10" />Kono ko nkumbu ja Nyambe kobuli ni kalile, mi inkumbu jakwe kwangu, taa nana jiwegwa uku takutusi cimwinya, kono nana beleka kuita bonse, mi tali nime, kono inkumbu ja Nyambe jikele kwangu. <verse eid="1CO 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 15:11" />Cwale nanga nime, kampa abo, ceco tu tandaza mi ceco namwa zumina.<verse eid="1CO 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukubuka kwetu ku bafwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 15:12" />Cwale ati na kutandazigwa buti Kilesite naga busigwa kuzwa ku bafwu, cinzi bamwinya aa batyo buti takuli ukubuka ku bafwu? <verse eid="1CO 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 15:13" />Ati takuli ukubuka ku bafwu, kambe Kilesite naje taa nala buki ku bafwu. <verse eid="1CO 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 15:14" />Mi ati Kilesite taa naga buka, ukutandaza kwetu kwa mbwashula, mi najo intumelo jenu nja mbwashula. <verse eid="1CO 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 15:15" />Mukunungako, kame kuti ku gwanaale buti tuli bampki ba Nyambe bo manya, ukuti natwa paka bya Nyambe buti Kilesite naga buka ku bafwa, kanti taa naga mubusa, ati aba nabafwu taba buki. <verse eid="1CO 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 15:16" />Cwale ati abafwu taba buki, Kilesite naje taa naga buka. <verse eid="1CO 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 15:17" />Mi ati Kilesite taa naga buka, intumelo jenu ja mbwashula, mi musikele mu bibi byenu. <verse eid="1CO 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 15:18" />Cwale babo aba naba fwila kwa Kilesite nabajunda. <verse eid="1CO 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 15:19" />Ati mwa bobuno ubumi bulyo tuli kwesi insepo kwa Kilesite, tuli kwesi ubumpai kuita abantu bonse.<verse eid="1CO 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 15:20" />Kono cwale Kilesite naga buka ku bafwu, ibiyango cetanzi ca babo na bafwa. <verse eid="1CO 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 15:21" />Ukuti ulufwu nalwa keza ko muntu, no kubuka ko bafwu ka muntu nakwa keza. <verse eid="1CO 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 15:22" />Ukuti abantu bonse basa fwa kebaka lya Adama, mi bonse kuti naba jojisigwe ka Kilesite. <verse eid="1CO 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 15:23" />Kono umuntu gense kuti na buke mwi nako jakwe, Kilesite iciyango cetanzi kwabo bonse, mi mpaa nakwize aba bakele kwakwe bonse mwi nako nagwiza kajo. <verse eid="1CO 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 15:24" />Cwale amamaninino kuti naga geze, Kilesite aa na tambike Umubuso kwa Nyambe Tata, aa sala jundisi ubumfumu bonse, no bujendesi ne nguzu. <verse eid="1CO 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 15:25" />Ukuti ali jelele ukujendesa kutwala aa natule aba bamulwisa mwisiko lyo matende gakwe. <verse eid="1CO 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 15:26" />Umulwisi go mamaninino na jundisigwe lufwu. <verse eid="1CO 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 15:27" />Ukuti “Nyambe naga tula ibintu byonse mwisiko lyo matende gakwe.” Cwale aa kutyo buti “Ibintu byonse” nabya tuligwa mwisiko lya lyakwe, cintu ci bonisa buti ije Nyambe tali tuliko, uju naga tula ibintu byonse mwisiko lya Klesite. <verse eid="1CO 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 15:28" />Mi ibintu byonse aa sebila tuligwi mwisiko lyakwe, mi Kilesite kuti na tuligwe munguzu jakwe, uju naga tula ibintu byonse mwisiko lyakwe, buti Nyambe atule ibintu byonse ku bantu bonse.<verse eid="1CO 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 15:29" />Cwale ati takuli ukubuka ku bafwu, cinzi naba tende babo aba naba kolobezigwa ko bafwu? Ati abafwu taa na babuke, cinzi abantu aa ba kolobezigwa kabo? <verse eid="1CO 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 15:30" />Mi neswe cinzi aa tujoja mu makababu inako jonse? <verse eid="1CO 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 15:31" />Bakwangu, nili gongweze, aa nisi kwesi inako jo kulitunta kenu kwa Kilesite Jesu Mfumwetu. <verse eid="1CO 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 15:32" />Aa nana lwa ne binyama mu munzi gwa Efese ko mukwa go buntu bulyo, cinzi nana gwana? Ati abafwu taba buki, sinagwe ubu kutyo buti, “Tulye no kunywa, ukuti ijona kuti na tufwe.”<verse eid="1CO 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 15:33" />Muleke ukuomigwa, ibitendantu bimagoju bwasa jona ibitendantu ibilotu. <verse eid="1CO 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 15:34" />Mubogwele ku migajalo jenu jo bugomba, mi muleke ukutenda icibi, nasa gamba bobo mu ku migenisa, ukuti bamwinya taba zekelele Nyambe.<verse eid="1CO 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umubili nagu buke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 15:35" />Kono jumwinya kuti abuze buti, “Buti ba bukila abafwu? Mu mufutanzi go mubili naba keze kago?” <verse eid="1CO 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 15:36" />Ubugelo bwenu! Ici ubyala ta cijoje, bwita acifwa. <verse eid="1CO 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 15:37" />Mi aa ubyala, tobyali umubili ugu gu keza, kono lubuto, bunga lo buloto kampa ulungi bulyo. <verse eid="1CO 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 15:38" />Kono Nyambe gasa luwa umubili ubu ashakila, mi gasa wa ulu buto umubili ko mufuta gwalo.<verse eid="1CO 15:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 15:39" />Mi imibili taji likozete jonse, abantu bali kwesi imibili jo kulikoza, imibili jo ibipagu bili kwesi imibili ji andene, no bijuni, mane mibili je inswii. <verse eid="1CO 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 15:40" />Mi kojili kame imibili ja kwigulu ne mibili ja ansi, kono kubega ko mibili ja kwigulu ja kulikoza, mi ukubega ko mibili ja ansi taji likozete. <verse eid="1CO 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CO 15:41" />Mi ukubega kwe juba kwa kulikoza, ne tuba lyo ntungwezi lingi, ukuti ituba lyo lutungwezi ta lu likozite ne tuba lya lumwinya ulutungwezi.<verse eid="1CO 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CO 15:42" />Cwale bobo naku kalile no kubuka ko bafwu. Umubili gu byaligwa kuti nagu bole, mi nagu buke uku tagu bolite. <verse eid="1CO 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CO 15:43" />Kuti gu byaligwe nagu nyazaala, mi gu buke nagu kwesi ituba, gwasa byelwa bufokolite, mi gu buke bukwesi inguzu. <verse eid="1CO 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CO 15:44" />Gwasa byalwa naguli umubili gwe nyama, mi kuti gu buke naguli umubili go moya. Ati ko guli umubili gwe nyama, kame ko guli umubili go moya. <verse eid="1CO 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CO 15:45" />Ukuti kulin’olitwe buti, “Adama umuntu gwe tanzi naga tendigwa umuntu ajoja, mi Adama go mamaninino, uju nagaba ubumi bo moya. <verse eid="1CO 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CO 15:46" />Cetaanzi tali ca moya, kono ca nyama, co moya casa umpilila co nyama. <verse eid="1CO 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CO 15:47" />Umuntu gwe tanzi evu lya ansi naga zwa, mi umuntu gwa bili kwigulu azwa. <verse eid="1CO 15:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CO 15:48" />Ubu akalile umuntu gwa ansi, mi ne bantu ba ansi bobo bakalile, mi ubu gekalile umuntu gwa kwigulu, mi ne bantu ba kwigulu bobo bekalile. <verse eid="1CO 15:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CO 15:49" />Mi sinagwe ubu tukozele iciswaniso co muntu gwa ansi, kuti natu koze bobo iciswaniso co muntu gwa kwigulu. <verse eid="1CO 15:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CO 15:50" />Cwale bakwangu, nasa mi lugwila buti, inyama ne malowa tabi goli uku jobola Umubuso gwa Nyambe, kampa ici cibola kujobola ici taciboli. <verse eid="1CO 15:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CO 15:51" />Mutegeleze, nasa mi lugwila intaba ji bikitwe, twense taa natu lale, kono twense bulyo natu zolwe, <verse eid="1CO 15:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CO 15:52" />mwi nako jonke mu kukowa ko linsho, mu ntolombita jo mamaninino. Ukuti intolombita kuti naji shugwaale, mi abafwu kuti naba buke uku taba bolite, mi kuti naba zoligwe. <verse eid="1CO 15:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CO 15:53" />Ukuti ici cibola naci jabale uku sabola, mi ici cifwa, naci jabale ku safwa. <verse eid="1CO 15:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CO 15:54" />Mi ici cibola, inako aa naci jabale ukusabola, mi ici cifwa ci jabale uku safwa, mi kuti nakwize umugambagwilo gu lin’olitwe buti, “Ulufwu nalwa minigwa ku kugolwa.<verse eid="1CO 15:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CO 15:55" />“Igwe gwe lufwu uku gola kwako kwibo kuli?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 15:55">Igwe gwe lufwu akamona kako kwibo kali?”<verse eid="1CO 15:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CO 15:56" />Mi akamona ko lufwu cibi, mi inguzu jo cibi mulao. <verse eid="1CO 15:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CO 15:57" />Cwale tulumbe Nyambe uju gatuwa ukugola ko Mfumwetu Jesu Kilesite. <verse eid="1CO 15:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CO 15:58" />Cwale bakwangu bashakigwa, mu gongole, muleke ukujoga, mi inako jonse mugongolekeze mu musebezi go Mfumu, ukuti mu lizekelele buti umusebezi gwenu mu Mfumu tali gwa mbwashula.<verse eid="1CO 15:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CO 16" />
  <para style="s1">Icitagilo co bazumini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 16:1" />Cwale ka byo citagilo ci tendelwa abantu bo Mfumu, mutende ubu nana tyo ku mankeleke ga Magalata ukutendela. <verse eid="1CO 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 16:2" />Mwi juba lye tanzi lyo nsunda ne nsunda, umuntu no muntu atulange kumbali masheleni kuja ubu ala gwanini, mi abike buti na kuleke ubu shakaala ukutenda icitagilo aa nanize. <verse eid="1CO 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 16:3" />Mi aa nani sike, kuti naniwe aman’olo ge nzibaazo ku bantu namwa zuminiza mi no kubatuma no ciwegwa cenu kwa Jelusalema. <verse eid="1CO 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 16:4" />Ati kuti nakujelele buti neme ni kaje kame, kuti naba ni sindikize.<verse eid="1CO 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Imigajalo ja Paulusi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 16:5" />Kuti nani keze kwenu aa seni la koshokanyi mu munzi gwa Masedoniya, ukuti kuti nani jende mu nzila ji koshokanya mwa Masedoniya. <verse eid="1CO 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 16:6" />Bunga kuti nani kale nenwe mwi nako ifuwi, kampa ku kalamo umweo gonse, buti na muni tuse mulujendo lwangu, konse uku na nije. <verse eid="1CO 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 16:7" />Ukuti tani shaki ukubona mwi nako nanize. Nasa shaka ukukala nenwe inakogana, ati Umfumu nani zuminiza. <verse eid="1CO 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 16:8" />Kono kuti nani kale mu munzi gwa Efese kutwala ijuba lyo Pentekota, <verse eid="1CO 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 16:9" />ukuti nana galwilwamo icinzi cinene co musebezi gwe nzwelopili, mi abangi basa nikananisa.<verse eid="1CO 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 16:10" />Mi Timoteya aa nageze, namu bone buti takuli ici agola ukujoga na kele nenwe, ukuti musebezi go Mfumu ugu a indite, sinagwe ubunikalile. <verse eid="1CO 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 16:11" />Mi kuleke kugwanaala umuntu uju namu nyanse, kono namu musindikize ko nkozo mu lujendo lwakwe buti na bogole kwangu, ukuti nili mulindile no bakwangu.<verse eid="1CO 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 16:12" />Cwale byo mukwetu Apolosi, nana mutandaza wawa buti ajende kwenu no bakwetu, kono taa kabi muli mu migajalo gwakwe kwiza ao bulyo. Mi kuti na kaje aa nagwane inako.<verse eid="1CO 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amajwi go mamaninino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 16:13" />Cwale mutonde, muzimane bugongwele mu ntumelo, mube no bundume, mube ne nguzu. <verse eid="1CO 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 16:14" />Mutende ibintu byonse mwi cisemo.<verse eid="1CO 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 16:15" />Cwale bakwangu, muli zekelele buti be njugo ja Setafanasi bo bazumini be tanzi mu munzi gwa Akaya, mi naba litombola uku belekela abantu ba Nyambe. <verse eid="1CO 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 16:16" />Nasa mi kumbila buti muli tule kwinsi lyo bantu ne ku muntu gense uju agwanana mu kubeleka neswe gogu musebezi.<verse eid="1CO 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 16:17" />Nana jangala Setafanasi, Fotunatusi na Akaikasi aa naba sika, ukuti naba niwa ibi taa kamu kwesi. <verse eid="1CO 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 16:18" />Mi naba nyangulula umoya gwangu mane na gwenu, mi abantu bo kukala bobo balijelele ukubulukigwa.<verse eid="1CO 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 16:19" />Amankeleke ga mu cilalanda ca Asiya gasa mi zumuniza. Akwila na Pulisila no nkeleke jili munjugo jabo kame ba mi zuminiza mwi zina lyo Mfumu. <verse eid="1CO 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 16:20" />Abakwabo bonse bala mi zuminiza, muli zuminize mu ku lisonsona ku cenete.<verse eid="1CO 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 16:21" />Ime ne Paulusi, nasa mi n’olela indagano ke ganja lyangu.<verse eid="1CO 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 16:22" />Ati umuntu ta shaki Umfumu, jojo muntu a kutigwe. Mfumu gwize! <verse eid="1CO 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 16:23" />Inkumbu jo Mfumu Jesu jibe nenwe.<verse eid="1CO 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 16:24" />Icisemo cangu cibe nenwe mwense ka Kilesite Jesu. Ameni.<verse eid="1CO 16:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 16" />
</usx>